{number: 17}
{title: Love Divine, All Love Excelling}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] Love divine, all [F] loves ex-[C] celling,
[F] Joy of [C] heaven, to [G7] earth come [C] down;
[C] Fix in us Thy [F] humble [C] dwelling,
[F] All Thy [C] faithful [G7] mercies [C] crown.
[G] Jesus, [C] Thou art [G] all com-[C] passion,
[F] Pure, un-[C] bounded [D7] love Thou [G] art;
[C] Visit us with [F] Thy sal-[C] vation,
[F] Enter [C] every [G7] trembling [C] heart.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[C] Breathe, O breathe Thy [F] loving [C] Spirit
[F] Into [C] every [G7] troubled [C] breast!
[C] Let us all in [F] Thee in-[C] herit,
[F] Let us [C] find that [G7] second [C] rest.
[G] Take a-[C] way the [G] love of [C] sinning,
[F] Alpha [C] and O-[D7] mega [G] be;
[C] End of faith, as [F] its be-[C] ginning,
[F] Set our [C] hearts at [G7] liber-[C] ty.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[C] Come, Almighty [F] to de-[C] liver,
[F] Let us [C] all Thy [G7] life re-[C] ceive;
[C] Suddenly re-[F] turn, and [C] never,
[F] Never-[C] more Thy [G7] temples [C] leave:
[G] Thee we [C] would be [G] always [C] blessing,
[F] Serve Thee [C] as Thy [D7] hosts a-[G] bove,
[C] Pray, and praise Thee [F] without [C] ceasing,
[F] Glory [C] in Thy [G7] perfect [C] love.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[C] Finish then Thy [F] new cre-[C] ation,
[F] Pure and [C] spotless [G7] let us [C] be;
[C] Let us see Thy [F] great sal-[C] vation
[F] Perfectly [C] re-[G7] stored in [C] Thee:
[G] Changed from [C] glory [G] into [C] glory,
[F] Till in [C] heaven we [D7] take our [G] place,
[C] Till we cast our [F] crowns be-[C] fore Thee,
[F] Lost in [C] wonder, [G7] love, and [C] praise.
{end_of_verse}
